Note that the last assertion is a bit redundant because the Count property always reflects the current count of the list regardless of the value of Old_arrListCount or New_arrListCount in the current method call. So, the Count property can never be less than the value of the Old_arrListCount or New_arrListCount. Hence, the last assertion can always evaluate to true, but I have included it in the code snippet for completeness.
